    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Derive from this class to disable the compiler-generated copy constructor and assignment. <ref refid="struct_t" kindref="compound">T</ref> should be the class that is deriving from <ref refid="class_non_copyable" kindref="compound">NonCopyable</ref>.</para>
<para>The purpose of the template parameter is to avoid any chance of getting a diamond-graph inheritance graph. Diamond graphs can lead to runtime overhead. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
